cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Digital Twin Viewer"
abstract: >-
  Digital Twin Viewer is an open-source, browser-based suite of interactive
  visualization and post-processing tools for coastal and shelf-sea model
  output. It renders ecosystem model fields and intertidal flat dynamics in
  three dimensions, provides point, transect, area and vertical-profile
  analysis, and integrates observational networks and field data for direct
  comparison with model output. It reads model output in NetCDF format with a
  structure similar to that produced by GETM-ERSEM-BFM; the Dutch Wadden Sea
  and the North-West European Shelf are example applications.
